# Live-mode toggles (committed; the pilot's own values are in
# .secrets/sync.env, which this overlay lists AFTER this file so it wins).
#
# Live mode is the customer-facing mode: the MCP surface is what an agent
# connects to and the dashboard is what a person opens, so both are armed
# here rather than left to an operator remembering an export. Before
# D-110.2 this line lived in the runbook as `export CORE_MCP_ENABLED=1`
# and its omission produced a healthy core serving 404 at /app/ (D-109.8).
CORE_MCP_ENABLED=1
